# OSE-1030 — see repo-root .npmrc for the full rationale (registry alias for
# @ocr/flags → @ourcommunityrituals/flags on GitHub Packages). This project-local
# copy exists because npm reads the .npmrc in the directory where `npm ci` runs,
# and WORKER_DIR (workers/oursharedevents) is one of those directories.
# @ocr/ui + @ocr/data-provider intentionally stay file:. Do not re-litigate.
@ourcommunityrituals:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
